## Scene Design Summary

The scene has:
- **Target**: Red wall banner at spawn-relative position (7, 2, 7), facing south, mounted on a stone brick wall
- **Distractors**: Blue wall banner at (-7, 3, 3), Green wall banner at (-3, 3, -5), White wall banner at (9, 3, -4)
- **Flat grass platform** from (-10, -1, -10) to (10, -1, 10)
- All structures are within a 20×20 block area

The task is achievable — the agent found the red wall banner within 20 steps in the sandbox test.

