  "response_to_critic": "Addressed both CommonSenseAgent and ValidatorAgent concerns: (1) Reduced max_distance from 16 to 5 — the red wall banner is at spawn-relative (8, 2, 7), which is ~10.6 blocks from spawn origin. With max_distance=5, the agent must walk at least ~5.6 blocks toward the banner before the distance check passes. This eliminates the trivial-at-spawn problem. (2) Tightened facing_tolerance from 60 to 45 degrees — ensures the agent is deliberately oriented toward the banner, not just coincidentally nearby. The sandbox preview confirmed the agent reaches the banner at steps 14-19 at approximately 3-5 blocks distance, so max_distance=5 is achievable but requires meaningful navigation through the occluder doorway.",
  "scene_clarification_request": "None — the SceneDesigner's Round 4 sandbox preview confirmed all positions. The red wall banner is at (8, 2, 7) facing south, the occluder wall blocks initial line of sight, and the agent successfully found the banner within 20 steps."
